  "content": "<h1>暗影飞行</h1><p><strong>模组说明</strong></p><p>将钻石锹装备在副手并使用特殊指令，即可获得喷气背包般的飞行能力！</p><p><em>支持服务端安装。仅需在服务器安装此模组，客户端无需安装。</em></p><p>由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗黑RPG</a>原班人马打造（若想体验完整RPG内容，可下载<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">暗黑RPG整合包</a>，享受任务与角色扮演玩法）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>特色功能</h2><p>（以下特性将进一步提升你的原版体验）</p><p>将钻石锹放入副手槽位（按F键切换），输入指令<strong>/trigger flight</strong>即可开始悬浮。当状态效果消失后，可再次使用该指令激活。</p><p>高空坠落时将自动获得缓降效果确保安全着陆。</p><p>将钻石锹装备至副手槽</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/506/681/offhand.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"447\" height=\"168\"></span></p><p>输入指令<strong>/trigger flight</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/506/680/trigger-flight.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"614\" height=\"104\"></span></p><p>获得飞行能力</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/506/679/2022-10-15_22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p><h5>&nbsp;</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即搭建服务器与好友同乐！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享25折优惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%